Package: CNAppR
Title: Copy Number Alterations Analysis and Integrative Exploration
Version: 1.5.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Authors@R: person("Alberto", "Torrejon Aquino",
           email = "alberto.torrejon.aquino@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides re-segmentation, scoring (BCS, FCS, GCS),
    genome-wide profiling, gene annotation, pathway enrichment (GSEA via
    fgsea), and survival analysis for somatic copy number alterations
    (CNAs). Supports WES and WGS data from BAM files and pre-segmented
    input. The package operates as a standalone R library without
    requiring a graphical interface.
